        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>战争 - 历史考点整理</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  col.col-time { width: 13%; }\n  col.col-war { width: 27%; }\n  col.col-point { width: 60%; }\n\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #cfd3d8;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    text-align: left;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  thead th {\n    background: #eceff2;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #d0342c;\n  }\n  .footer-mark {\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .heart {\n    color: #e88ea3;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>战争</h1>\n\n<table>\n  <colgroup>\n    <col class=\"col-time\">\n    <col class=\"col-war\">\n    <col class=\"col-point\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>时间</th>\n      <th>战争</th>\n      <th>考点</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"red\">1066开始</span></td>\n      <td>诺曼征服 The Norman Conquest</td>\n      <td>\n        1.William the Conqueror (William I)威廉一世(征服者),<br>\n        2.两种语言Anglo-Saxon 和Norman语<br>\n        3. 1086The Domesday Book末日书威廉一世搞的土地调查记录\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1066年</td>\n      <td>黑斯廷斯之战Battle of Hastings</td>\n      <td>Bayeux tapestry《贝叶挂毯》记录了该战争。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1314</td>\n      <td>班诺克本战役 Bannockburn</td>\n      <td>\n        1.the Scottish king Robert the Bruce第一次苏格兰独立战争<br>\n        2.来自苏格兰的君主： king Robert the Bruce罗伯特布<br>\n        3.来自荷兰的君主： 查理二世（既是荷兰那个）\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1337至1453</td>\n      <td>英法百年战争Hundred Years War</td>\n      <td>英、法两国在存在间断续进行的战争</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1455-1485</td>\n      <td>玫瑰之战Wars of Roses</td>\n      <td>约克和兰卡斯特家族对战</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"red\">1588这个时间考</span></td>\n      <td>英国海军 打败西班牙无敌舰队 伊丽莎白一世</td>\n      <td>the English defeated the Spanish Armada打败西班牙无敌舰队，标志着日不落帝国的崛起。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1642-1646<br>查理一世</td>\n      <td>英国内战 Civil War 第一次</td>\n      <td>\n        1.保皇派和国会的斗争<br>\n        2.保皇派＝the Cavalier<br>\n        3.国会=Parliament=the Roundheads（圆头是国会，议员都得头）\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1648-1649<br>查理一世</td>\n      <td>英国内战Civil War第二次</td>\n      <td>\n        著名战役：<br>\n        1644The Battle of Marston Moor马斯顿荒原战役<br>\n        1645The Battle of Naseby纳西比战役\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1649-1651<br>查理二世</td>\n      <td>英国内战Civil War第三次</td>\n      <td>\n        1.查理一世被处死1649年；defeated by Oliver Cromwell 被克伦威尔打败；<br>\n        2.查理二世流亡荷兰，躲到一个oak树下面<br>\n        3.克伦威尔死了1658年，查理二世又回来复辟即位。<br>\n        （一世老被处死，二世儿子演戏)\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1815</td>\n      <td>滑铁卢之战Battle of Waterloo</td>\n      <td>英国和法国最后一战大，也是拿破仑一战最后一战</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1853 to 1856</td>\n      <td>克里米亚战争Crimean War － 英国/Russia打</td>\n      <td>是第一场被媒体通过新闻报道和照片广泛报道的战争。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1899 to 1902</td>\n      <td>波尔战争The Boer War</td>\n      <td>South Africa with settlers from the Netherlands called the Boers. （荷兰移民-南非-波尔战争）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"red\">1914-1918</span></td>\n      <td>一战 11.11.11结束</td>\n      <td>\n        1.一战爆发原因1914奥地利archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austri被刺剌<br>\n        2.一战反法西斯了1658年，开始有投票权30岁\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"red\">1939-1945</span></td>\n      <td>二战</td>\n      <td>AIR WWII德国入侵波兰是二战开始 1939会考</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1940</td>\n      <td>敦刻尔克大撤退Dunkirk spirit 精神</td>\n      <td>是第二次世界大战初期的英法联军的军事撤退行动</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1940</td>\n      <td>不列颠之战Battle of Britain 英/德空军之战</td>\n      <td>aerial battle between Germany and Britain in the summer （空军-英国和德国二战）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>The Battle of Trafalgar</td>\n      <td>Admiral Nelson</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"footer-mark\">\n  <span class=\"heart\">♡</span> @家务通书 &nbsp; From 小红书\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
